A.11 Proof of Theorem 6.3 (Authority Separation Reduces Blast Radius)

Theorem 6.3. Separating capability from authority reduces the expected blast radius:

\mathbb{E}[B_{\text{sep}}] \le \mathbb{E}[B_{\text{unsep}}]

