A.12 Proof of Proposition 7.1 (Byzantine Collaboration Tax)

Proposition 7.1. For f > 0, the collaboration tax satisfies

\mathrm{CT}^{(N)}_{\text{Byz}} \ge \mathrm{CT}^{(N)} + f \cdot N \cdot \Delta_{\text{Byz}}

