\ge V(\mathcal{G}_{\text{full}}) - V(\mathcal{G}^{(N)}) + f \cdot N \cdot d \cdot p_{\text{contam}} \cdot \Delta_{\text{Byz}}

= \mathrm{CT}^{(N)} + f \cdot N \cdot \Delta_{\text{Byz}}

where \Delta_{\text{Byz}} = d \cdot p_{\text{contam}} \cdot \Delta_{\text{Byz}}. \blacksquare

