p_{ij}^{\text{Byz,sep}} \le p_{ij}^{\text{Byz,unsep}}

Step 3: Spectral radius comparison. The next-generation matrices satisfy:

K^{\text{Byz,sep}} \le K^{\text{Byz,unsep}} \quad \text{(componentwise)}

By the monotonicity of the spectral radius:

R_c^{\text{Byz,sep}} \le R_c^{\text{Byz,unsep}}

Step 4: Blast radius comparison. By Theorem 5.1:

\mathbb{E}[B_{\text{Byz,sep}}] \le \mathbb{E}[B_{\text{Byz,unsep}}]

